{"id":"n32554-1-9","stage":2,"title":"깔리다 · 被铺","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n32554-1-9-1","ko":"운동장에 잔디가 새로 깔렸대!","zh":"听说操场的草坪刚换新的呢！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"운동장에","meaning":"运动场，体育场","explanation":"운동장：运动场，体育场；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"운동장","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26891","senseId":"1","lemma":"운동장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잔디가","meaning":"草皮，草地","explanation":"잔디：草皮，草地；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"잔디","audio":"/audio/d5d5ec50a1ba7a31da19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24839","senseId":"1","lemma":"잔디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"새로","meaning":"重新","explanation":"새로：重新","readings":[{"term":"새로","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67896","senseId":"2","lemma":"새로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"깔렸대!","meaning":"被铺","explanation":"깔리다：被铺；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"깔리다","audio":"/audio/cdd3d38beb49bba69b84.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32554","senseId":"1","lemma":"깔리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"899e5787d5587fd1","term":"운동장","zh":"运动场，体育场","audio":"/audio/899e5787d5587fd1d0c4.mp3","entryId":"26891","definition":"为能够进行体育比赛、游玩等而设有多种器具或设施的宽阔场所。","pronunciation":["운ː동장"]},{"id":"d5d5ec50a1ba7a31","term":"잔디","zh":"草皮，草地","audio":"/audio/d5d5ec50a1ba7a31da19.mp3","entryId":"24839","definition":"庭院、公园、高尔夫球场等地种植的叶子短细、生长茂密的草。","pronunciation":["잔디"]},{"id":"06c6c05757e97038","term":"새로","zh":"重新","audio":"/audio/06c6c05757e97038ad2a.mp3","entryId":"67896","definition":"与以前不同，全新地；或用新的。","pronunciation":["새로"]},{"id":"cdd3d38beb49bba6","term":"깔리다","zh":"被铺","audio":"/audio/cdd3d38beb49bba69b84.mp3","entryId":"32554","definition":"东西被摊平在地面上。","pronunciation":["깔리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9b06fd8d3c4f9ca7be51.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n32554-1-9-2","ko":"우리 그럼 거기서 축구 하자!","zh":"那我们就在那儿踢足球吧！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거기서","meaning":"那儿，那里","explanation":"거기：那儿，那里；서：에서 的缩略，表示动作地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"거기","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62258","senseId":"2","lemma":"거기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하자!","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"86f87d3fb9919f14","term":"그럼","zh":"那么，既然那样","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3","entryId":"60346","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그럼"]},{"id":"8c91c4ef7e321cf6","term":"거기","zh":"那儿，那里","audio":"/audio/8c91c4ef7e321cf67426.mp3","entryId":"62258","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的地方。","pronunciation":["거기"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/